    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member",
        "text": "The... the Yetis..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member",
        "text": "...I feel so bad for them to all die in Lungmen like that. One less hope, one less legend for the Infected."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member",
        "text": "Move it. The L. G. D. are on the way."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_043_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nine",
        "text": "I know."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_043_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member",
        "text": "...There's something not quite right about your eyes."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member",
        "text": "To be honest, I always thought you were a spy for Lungmen."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_043_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nine",
        "text": "How about now?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_043_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member",
        "text": "No one would believe it anyway."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_043_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nine",
        "text": "A real spy would kill you to keep you quiet."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_043_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member",
        "text": "I'm not worried about you killing me. Look at the state of Lungmen. Even if you were a Lungmenite, you can't go back."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member",
        "text": "You'd have an even worse time than we did."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_043_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nine",
        "text": "...So I'm not. I'm not really anything anymore."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_043_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member",
        "text": "What are you doing? Wow, is that a flower?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member",
        "text": "Oooh, is this your Arts? It's pretty."
    },
