    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "\u2014\u2014Wire?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_017_homura_3#6",
            "name2": "avg_npc_041",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "You don't really want to kill me, do you? You can use Arts."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_017_homura_3#5",
            "name2": "avg_npc_041",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "I've always heard that men who use wires as weapons are all, literally all, psychopaths."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_017_homura_3#5",
            "name2": "avg_npc_041",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "Indeed, they do say that..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_039_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Censor",
        "text": "Infected, do not interfere with official business. Take care that I lump you in with the others."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_017_homura_3#5"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "Not much to be done about unidentified armed units getting killed on the battlefield, is there?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_017_homura_3#5",
            "name2": "avg_npc_041",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "We can likewise testify that you are acting in coordination with Reunion."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "You don't have the authority to investigate my partner."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_041",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "We are well aware that a vessel belonging to an 'Infected Countermeasures Specialist' is docked in a Lungmen berth, Superintendent Ch'en. This is the only reason Miss Blaze has not yet come to harm."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_041",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Then how much more do you need to see? How much more must you test the people of this city with their very lives?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_039_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Censor",
        "text": "Speak with respect. We are assessing Lungmen's risk control capabilities due to the importance with which we regard you."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Then forgive me. I'll rephrase."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Are you enjoying this farce?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_039_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Censor",
        "text": "Pfft."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Stand down, Blaze. We do not serve these fine, upstanding individuals, and they're not with the raincoats either."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_017_homura_3#5",
            "name2": "avg_npc_041",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "Apologies, Miss Blaze. I hope I did not cause you any displeasure."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_017_homura_3#5",
            "name2": "avg_npc_041",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "...You're very polite. But your tone pisses me off."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_017_homura_3#5",
            "name2": "avg_npc_041",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "You have an ear for Yan speech."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "You inherited much from your father. Alas, now you are but an Infected. Your path is rough. And short."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_017_homura_3#6",
            "name2": "avg_npc_041",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "......You......?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_040"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Taihe",
        "text": "Come."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_041"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "Goodbye then, Miss Blaze, Superintendent Ch'en."
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_017_homura_3#6"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "Wait! What did you just say about my dad?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "Stop!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Blaze!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_017_homura_3#5"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Remember the mission!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_017_homura_3#5"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "Right."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Officer Ch'en."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "We found no trace of the enemy commander."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Which?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "We only know of Mephisto."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Let Rhodes Island handle the rest."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "No need to rush into it. This campaign is all but over."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "But he has to pay... for the atrocities he committed."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Then we'll leave it to you."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Let's part ways for now. I have one more thing I need to see with my own eyes."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_017_homura_3#5"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "Wait a minute, L. G. D. lady."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "name2": "char_017_homura_3#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "What is it?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "name2": "char_017_homura_3#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "...Thanks for that, back there."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "That's all."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "name2": "char_017_homura_3#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Sure. You too."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
