    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "How do you feel?"
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "You.;......;Can I help you?",
            "values": "1;2;3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": "1;2;3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "I was in the neighborhood."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Your emotional state is fluctuating. It seems you had a deeper interaction with this Reunion unit in the Chernobog ruins."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "As far as I can tell, the captain of this unit did not participate in the battle."
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "That means...",
            "values": "1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Lungmen won't keep chasing these Infected. But Rhodes Island has to do more."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Lungmen won't interfere with what happens next. And you can choose not to participate."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "...But you will participate. Whether the Infected is codenamed 'Mephisto' or 'FrostNova.'"
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "Where are you going?",
            "values": "1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "I have my work cut out for me."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Oh, and Dr. {@nickname}......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Don't look at me like that."
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "Stop with the cloak and dagger.;......;Amiya said Rhodes Island needs trust.",
            "values": "1;2;3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": "1;2;3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "But you and I don't need trust."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "You need the trust of Rhodes Island's operators, not me."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "\u2014\u2014I know you too well to trust you. Just like you never trusted me, in the old days."
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "How would I know the old days?;The old days?;Is there anything I can do about it now?",
            "values": "1;2;3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": "1;2;3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Right."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "I misspoke. Forget it."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Be careful in the next operation. Only the most dangerous of commanders would train such a squad of Infected who would fight to the death without flinching."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Of course, it's up to you if you want to see it through to the end."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "And do conserve your energy. We may not have time to rest."
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "The battle for Lungmen is over.",
            "values": "1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "It's not that simple. At least, that's what I think."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Dr. {@nickname}, from now on, it's up to you to decide if you will shoulder the burden of responsibility for Rhodes Island..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "...'Whether or not to be one worthy of the trust of a Rhodes Island operator.'"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
