    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_016"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman",
        "text": "Ah, FrostNova, ma'am, you're awake..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman",
        "text": "...Take it easy! Let me help you."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1505_frstar_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova",
        "text": "I'm fine. I'm not... so fragile."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_016",
            "name2": "char_1505_frstar_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman",
        "text": "\u2014\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman",
        "text": "Where are you going? You can't go back."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_016",
            "name2": "char_1505_frstar_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova",
        "text": "Then, my brothers and sisters..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_016",
            "name2": "char_1505_frstar_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman",
        "text": "...You can't go back!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman",
        "text": "It was for your sake that they..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1505_frstar_1#9"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova",
        "text": "Don't insult my squad!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_016",
            "name2": "char_1505_frstar_1#9",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman",
        "text": "Ugh!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1505_frstar_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova",
        "text": "They did... *cough* look out for me."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova",
        "text": "But it was for the Infected that they gave their lives so bravely!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova",
        "text": "They fought their last battle so that more of their people could live, not for the sake of any one person!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova",
        "text": "*Cough* *cough hack* *cough*..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova",
        "text": "*Cough* Guh... Mmg..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_016",
            "name2": "char_1505_frstar_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman",
        "text": "FrostNova, ma'am..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_016",
            "name2": "char_1505_frstar_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova",
        "text": "Enough with the ma'am. Are you calling me that because I look weak to you?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_016",
            "name2": "char_1505_frstar_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman",
        "text": "......!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman",
        "text": "Sorry!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman",
        "text": "It's just, they put you in our care like this."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_016",
            "name2": "char_1505_frstar_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova",
        "text": "And now they're gone, and I never got to keep my promises to them."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova",
        "text": "I don't even have a chance to make amends."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_016",
            "name2": "char_1505_frstar_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman",
        "text": "FrostNova..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_016",
            "name2": "char_1505_frstar_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova",
        "text": "...The one slumped at the wall there."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova",
        "text": "Mephisto."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova",
        "text": "He's still unconscious?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_016",
            "name2": "char_1505_frstar_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman",
        "text": "We don't know. He's been like that the whole time. He says nothing. Does nothing."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_016",
            "name2": "char_1505_frstar_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova",
        "text": "Take him back. It's enough."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_016",
            "name2": "char_1505_frstar_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman",
        "text": "Understood. Phew, I thought you'd..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_016",
            "name2": "char_1505_frstar_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova",
        "text": "I'd what?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_016",
            "name2": "char_1505_frstar_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman",
        "text": "I thought you'd kill him."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_016",
            "name2": "char_1505_frstar_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova",
        "text": "There's no need for that anymore. I think I know what happened outside the slums."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova",
        "text": "That disheartened look in his eyes..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_016",
            "name2": "char_1505_frstar_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman",
        "text": "Oh...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_016",
            "name2": "char_1505_frstar_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova",
        "text": "...And, from time to time..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova",
        "text": "I recall that day, three or four years ago, when he tried his very hardest to sing."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_016",
            "name2": "char_1505_frstar_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman",
        "text": "He can sing? But Faust said, his throat..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_016",
            "name2": "char_1505_frstar_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova",
        "text": "He really tried."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova",
        "text": "Just like all of us Infected. Though we will all someday succumb to Oripathy..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova",
        "text": "We still try our very hardest to live."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova",
        "text": "Let the rest of his life continue to punish him."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1505_frstar_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova",
        "text": "Tell me, Phantom Crossbowman, was Rhodes Island involved in that fight?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_016",
            "name2": "char_1505_frstar_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman",
        "text": "Do you mean...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman",
        "text": "...No, as far as I know, they didn't fight the Yetis."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1505_frstar_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova",
        "text": "...So childish."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_016",
            "name2": "char_1505_frstar_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman",
        "text": "Are you sure you want to stay?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman",
        "text": "They may not come after us, FrostNova. You don't have to die here."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1505_frstar_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova",
        "text": "I met a few people in the ruins. I want to see them again."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova",
        "text": "I promised them, actually."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova",
        "text": "And I know they're coming."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1505_frstar_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman",
        "text": "FrostNova..."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 1,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova",
        "text": "Go on, brother."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova",
        "text": "Reunion lost this battle. And just maybe, Reunion did wrong."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova",
        "text": "But you haven't. You still have a choice, you can do better."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova",
        "text": "Go on. And don't look back."
    },
    {
